* <Natural Source Header
* RPFKEX2C EXECUTE PF-key cmds directly after input for G-AUTOCOMMIT='I'
*
* MAINTENANCE:
* SU1     2017-09-13 NOM 3.5: created
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
IF G-AUTOCOMMIT = 'I'
  DECIDE ON FIRST VALUE OF G-PF-FUNC
    VALUE 'HELP'
      REINPUT USING HELP /*avoid NAT1108 - directly after input Ü
    VALUE 'EXIT'
      INCLUDE C-ESCAP2
/*    INCLUDE C-ESCAPE
    NONE VALUE IGNORE
  END-DECIDE
END-IF
** End of copycode RPFKEX2C ********************************************
